  #set text(font: "Calibri", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72.006pt, 468.96pt, "Figure 5. (A) DFT (blue dashed curve) and GW bandstructures (solid red curve). (B) Exciton band structure ")
  #line-at(72.006pt, 482.285pt, "colored by exciton-phonon scattering rate and with an arrow at the initial state for the BTE. The inset shows ")
  #line-at(72.006pt, 495.721pt, "the contour line of the exciton-phonon scattering rate of the initial state in the Q space. (C) Real-space BTE ")
  #line-at(72.006pt, 509.157pt, "image from t=0 to 100 fs. (D) Exciton diffusivity of the first exciton band. ")
  #line-at(72.006pt, 536.028pt, "Discussion ")
  #set text(font: "Calibri", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72.006pt, 549.464pt, "The order-of-magnitude agreement between our experimentally measured and theoretically predicted ")
  #line-at(71.984pt, 562.899pt, "transport parameters for monolayer BP, together with the first-principles account of the transport ")
  #line-at(71.984pt, 576.335pt, "anisotropy, points to a consistent picture in which exciton-phonon scattering reduces the transport ")
  #line-at(71.984pt, 589.771pt, "anisotropy relative to the anisotropy of the band structure. They furthermore suggest that the strategy ")
  #line-at(71.984pt, 603.206pt, "that we employed to obtain bulk values from stroboSCAT experiments should be relatively accurate as ")
  #line-at(71.984pt, 616.532pt, "well. Diffusion coefficients for electronic excited states for the armchair and zigzag axes have been ")
  #line-at(71.984pt, 629.967pt, "previously measured by both ultrafast transmission electron microscopy (TEM) and transient reflectance ")
  #line-at(71.984pt, 643.403pt, "microscopy (and correspond primarily to hole transport) ")
  #set text(font: "Calibri", size: 6.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(329.52pt, 639.48pt, "50,51")
  #set text(font: "Calibri", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(345.24pt, 643.44pt, ". Armchair diffusivity values in the range of ")
  #line-at(72pt, 656.876pt, "~1300 cm")
  #set text(font: "Calibri", size: 6.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
