  #line-at(362.04pt, 530.04pt, ". Briefly, a 630 nm pump pulse was ")
  #line-at(71.997pt, 542.637pt, "generated by a Light Conversion non-collinear optical parametric amplifier (model PN13F1) using the ")
  #line-at(71.997pt, 555.355pt, "third harmonic of the fundamental 1080 nm seed pulse from a Light Conversion Pharos laser (model ")
  #line-at(71.997pt, 567.951pt, "10-200-PP). A 730 nm probe pulse was generated by a Light Conversion non-collinear optical ")
  #line-at(71.986pt, 580.669pt, "parametric amplifier (model PN15F2) using the second harmonic of the fundamental seed pulse. The ")
  #line-at(71.986pt, 593.266pt, "laser repetition rate was 200 kHz; the pump was modulated at 660 Hz, and the pump-probe delay times ")
  #line-at(71.986pt, 605.863pt, "were controlled by a mechanical stage. ")
  #line-at(71.986pt, 631.42pt, "The pump and probe beams were spatially filtered through 25 ")
  #set text(font: "Cambria Math", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(354.345pt, 631.42pt, "µ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(360.229pt, 631.42pt, "m and 50 ")
  #set text(font: "Cambria Math", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(406.432pt, 631.42pt, "µ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(412.426pt, 631.42pt, "m pinholes, respectively. ")
  #line-at(71.986pt, 644.138pt, "The pump beam was telescoped to a diameter of 12 mm, while the probe beam was telescoped to 1 mm ")
  #line-at(71.986pt, 656.735pt, "and focused into the back focal plane of the objective of a home-built microscope using an ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 11.04pt, weight: "regular", style: "italic", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(472.547pt, 656.735pt, "f")
